==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|resistivities}}
# {{label|en|physics}} In general, the resistance to electric current of a material. In particular, the degree to which a [[material]] resists the flow of [[electricity]] or [[heat]].
# The [[reciprocal]] of [[conductivity]].
SI unit (electricity): ohm-metre (Ω-m)

